{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "8e968945ede832862dd42bb4442692cd9eca5919d9e1f81b7a158ef9bab361ee", "ja": "出演Chu→MEMBER", "zh": "演出Chu→MEMBER", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0c9aa34b3ba91a0d3676cd52210280c354e61d46e9c5fb6e51ff37084ede8f65", "ja": "ウェブ生放送の収録に来た公演メンバー達。\n百合子はプレッシャーとレッスン疲れからミ\nスを連発。周囲のフォローでどうにか乗り切\nるも、ますます思いつめた百合子は、今から\n無理にでも自主練をすると言い放った。", "zh": "公演成员们前来参与网路直播。\n压力及训练累积的疲惫致使百合子错误百出。\n在其他人的协助之下总算是平安落幕，\n但百合子却陷入钻牛角尖的状态，\n逞强着坚持要立刻去自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc447a46ef08f7013edb55319d9b66f773499e324619adc8c9e64c1f85f394dc", "ja": "（今日は、ウェブ生放送がある。\n地方公演の情報も、初出しされる予定だ）", "zh": "（今天有网路直播，\n也预计要首次公开地方公演的资讯。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d2ede3e2e22afcf2cf21cfd38e684685ba6b46854cd3b24c1d8088bcfb171324", "ja": "（今回の公演では、杏奈と百合子の成長を期待して、\nいろいろ任せて……みているのだが……）", "zh": "（在这次的公演中，我期望杏奈及百合子有所成长，\n所以尝试把各种工作交给她们处理……不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "3602b7d4e1d74183fc4959eb50859cd1e2b39826e49d3455ec96a98d86f2f964", "ja": "………………はぁ。", "zh": "………………唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "299fc24dc26181eda1aa9f40b917f96bd71cad357cbefade05a986638e0f4f6a", "ja": "百合子さん、大丈夫？\n元気……、ない……。", "zh": "百合子，你还好吗？\n感觉……没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "ba62cbe0d6565eb33ce3964b87f97283e422562a4191dab7d120652d1dcd21eb", "ja": "はっ！？　あ、杏奈ちゃん！　あ、あはは……。\n大丈夫だよ、うん。ちょっと疲れただけ。", "zh": "啊！？小、小杏！啊、啊哈哈……\n我没事啦，嗯。只是有点累而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "150d952814d0dc2dd8ee14502f6479ae5691c0e231b3c05ce1a463e78f2a87ad", "ja": "ちょっとって感じじゃ、なさそうですけど。\n本当に大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "我看你好像不只是有点累而已。\n真的不要紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b8442b90c44a1733bcd326062207789f2a67422e20bd3c565d039f389367157", "ja": "ダメですよ、百合子ちゃん。倒れてからじゃ\n遅いんです。今すぐ寝てください！", "zh": "这样不行喔，百合子。\n万一真的累倒就太迟了，请马上去休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b43861e081b7a5818dd749e10268a1930e407866b347fc48a024cea34d2597e", "ja": "百合子ちゃんの寝顔は、\nありさが全力でお守りします！　ムフーッ！", "zh": "百合子的睡脸，就由亚利沙用全心全意来守护！\n唔呼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c27eafe260e4c7250c9e7a741621f817113c6b6f72fe6d65f5eecc203d7b70e0", "ja": "まて、まず亜利沙が落ち着こう。……でも、\n百合子、無理ならちゃんと言うんだぞ？", "zh": "等等，亚利沙你先冷静一下。\n……不过，百合子，要是真的累了你一定要说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "5520e15d8665b8fc9272bcee697ea5bfac83ea7b7f14144ec02bf08b3bb19821", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！\n地方公演の告知もあるんだし、頑張らなきゃ……！", "zh": "不、不要紧的！\n况且还要宣传地方公演，得努力才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1010_staff", "source_sha256": "d61d044324652e271dcf99584fe2afeffd2a21d898f2153cbe8c0cfdf9797329", "ja": "765プロのみなさーん！\nそろそろスタンバイ、お願いします！", "zh": "765艺能的各位──！\n差不多该准备上场了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3f712a1f99ce46333a185444672e76b2f74a9cff9c551995abf0276579867fa5", "ja": "（百合子……責任がプレッシャーになってるのかな。\nこれは、ちょっと……）", "zh": "（百合子……责任是不是对她造成压力了呢？\n这可不太好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "12212a449df8b12bf758e6961eeee70b3d150512379efd327c8c6a4855fb6859", "ja": "こんにちは！　今日は、ありさたちの新情報、\nたっぷりお届けしちゃいますよ～！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "大家好！\n今天要为各位送上我们满满的新消息喔～！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fcc841b3e218bd16ebf83b3524eb494380f76031ebc145055dcd69f3fb307709", "ja": "お相手は765プロの、リリーナイトと～……？", "zh": "陪伴大家的是，765艺能的lilyknight以及～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "7211b1f298f0c2bf57208dbf6050dad85c97de0dc4b4f9df56f826e3707b1ba6", "ja": "望月杏奈と～……って、百合子さん！\n名前、そっちじゃなくて！", "zh": "望月杏奈跟……等等，百合子！\n不是这个名字！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "88fda5a0151e9098e6ff4796ad4fedba2baa84c5325ea2a0e9da1466ac90588c", "ja": "なんですか、リリーナイトって……？", "zh": "lilyknight是什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "30117ac479df9f6596b88bb9a2eb9091dc65dba11e149d0e17d81531b2d217c1", "ja": "わああっ！？　ご、ごめんなさい間違えました！\n七尾百合子、七尾百合子です～っ！", "zh": "哇啊啊！？对、对不起我讲错了！\n七尾百合子，我是七尾百合子～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "f20cbbe11cc65ccfc6af58b0944b50af3f4188e7f4c143a5de36f86bb7bf4d48", "ja": "それじゃ、クイズの回答は……。\n百合子さん、答えをどうぞ。", "zh": "接下来，谜题的答案……\n请百合子回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "cfb75e2f4acd297466e6479141bc4689d42211c4dc22e2219b4ab9e66b2670b2", "ja": "……えっ？　あ、はいっ！\n答えは、ええっと……マル！", "zh": "……咦？啊，好的！\n答案是，这个嘛……圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "e50460f9890334ea1712eafaf693bb2312bbd10a1e0bb4a3af31e0e80450a490", "ja": "って、百合子さん！？\nこれ、マルバツクイズじゃないよー！", "zh": "呃，百合子！？\n这不是圈叉问答啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "501a71e7b768820d2befafc49fa8c6bcae79ca63784a7ba053c53d2d3932aeae", "ja": "ひぃっ！？　ご、ごめんなさい～！", "zh": "咦！？对、对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "7f6ec4f6746fed679a29fd184ee6ec84ec757b00b443bf7d7289e6aece5b1450", "ja": "お、惜しいです百合子ちゃん！　\nまる……いお月様、ではありませんでしたーっ！", "zh": "好、好可惜呢，百合子！\n答案不是圈……圆圈状的月亮喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "1e9120dd4f85581b6a0c47892aa6472aa9321aac96ab510b83bbcdf8a007353e", "ja": "そろそろ、お別れの時間だね。それじゃあここで、\nプレゼントのお知らせだよっ☆", "zh": "差不多该跟大家说再见了呢。\n那么，现在有礼物要送给大家喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "c12a20bfe7e927ff134c7d1c5ffc0550ac4776848ede35bebfbccb1c3ce62ed8", "ja": "はいっ！　ええと……\nこちらの、私たちのサイン入りポスターを抽選で……", "zh": "是的！这个嘛……\n这些是我们的签名海报，将会以抽签的方式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "429ae1716752c9cf85128c27f6286a62185df32e620b008a1536d939424cc114", "ja": "ひええっ！？　百合子ちゃん、それ別の番組のです！\nポスターは、えっとえっと……あっ、こっちでした～！", "zh": "呜呀！？百合子，那是别的节目的！\n亚利沙看看，海报是在……啊，在这里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "b8a1cb6874f8798ed1e863cb441860da4ce51997341c42224297ee5b7a459b53", "ja": "えっ……あ、あああっ……！", "zh": "咦……啊、啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "2c452f0b1df2f726d941b598056fe4842d2bc58b7dde8d4d4798f1b03b486fb9", "ja": "あの……みなさんと、ステージでお会いできるのを\n楽しみにしています。では、この辺で。", "zh": "那个……我们很期待能跟大家在公演上见面。\n那么，就先聊到这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "0de1a718e3774f276e2cd022a322a51036a77c2531a339dc7f321b3c33906f3f", "ja": "ば、ばいばーい……！", "zh": "拜、拜拜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "6dc4590679f38f2f941e8cc12f582d87476aba4927474d4e296f9dc20a13d168", "ja": "ばいばーい！", "zh": "拜拜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "6dc4590679f38f2f941e8cc12f582d87476aba4927474d4e296f9dc20a13d168", "ja": "ばいばーい！", "zh": "拜拜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "6dc4590679f38f2f941e8cc12f582d87476aba4927474d4e296f9dc20a13d168", "ja": "ばいばーい！", "zh": "拜拜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "52e97471667523cbf99af4abb4b8aaac77b040ac15344285abf9dd27ba537430", "ja": "うう、ごめんなさいごめんなさい！　私、悪夢のような\n失敗ばっかりで……もう立ち直れません……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起对不起！我一直出天大的错……\n我已经振作不起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "4f6f2da66a6d6e0cb7893cc5e15489703b969a63160a16c8c7572df97dd15fe3", "ja": "いや、その……そんなに落ち込まなくて大丈夫だよ。\n視聴者にはウケてたらしいぞ！", "zh": "不，那个……你也不需要这么消沉啦。\n听说观众都觉得很有趣喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "ee48785800c507977203bf2ed38fb2c90c314585ab58bde1bff955a506acd2e8", "ja": "……それは放送事故だからですよね？\nNG集とか衝撃映像みたいなモノですよね？？", "zh": "……那是因为播出事故的关系吧？\n就像NG集锦或惊险画面的那种效果吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2a292dcf50140b7d9bff4e70db599d11e5513e0900efdd72cacd96db4c981cb2", "ja": "まあ、衝撃映像は言いすぎだと思うが……。", "zh": "不，用惊险画面来形容太过头了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "b827b35c7a1430b92c5f39cc782666a39218a6eaa8cd12631edceea2255c762a", "ja": "はあ……。タイムリープして、生放送の前から\nやり直す力があればいいのに……。", "zh": "唉……要是我拥有穿越时空的能力，\n能够回到现场直播开始前重来一次就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "c47deeb0bdf630ee34c18bbcc4192663fb0629cae9924639fcb2fc8c75a2d018", "ja": "お疲れさま、です……。\n志保と亜利沙、次のお仕事に行った、よ……。", "zh": "辛苦了……\n志保跟亚利沙，到下一个工作地点去了喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "82b1b86b0904277954f20feb88bb52789fa955335cf081bbc7f40c620c8e6521", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう杏奈。\n二人も、そろそろ帰った方がいいな。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你，杏奈。\n你们两个也差不多该回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "023c65a13f3a482703e2c3983f226e1d3394caa850a86eec3a0a5228fe3e65e9", "ja": "……。あの、{$P$}さんは\nこの後、劇場に帰るんですか？", "zh": "……请问，{$P$}先生，\n你等一下会回剧场去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "995e0a3dc131c86239c09306ff7ebbaaad3871f7d598d5493e8c8c451a1bea92", "ja": "うん？　そのつもりだけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？我是打算回去没错，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "371d380b36a242d6a4069aa6cf09d87f00a3aee22f16248ff87c74190d158e52", "ja": "だったら、一緒に行ってもいいですか？\n自主練していこうかな、って……。", "zh": "那我可以跟你一起回去吗？\n我想做点自主练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "129d64e906616ac2a6947b2b77d110632d4d7bf4ee3fe5989b20eae96c2d59a9", "ja": "え、今から？　いや、それは……。\nというか百合子は、ちょっと休んだ方がいいと思う。", "zh": "咦，现在回去练习吗？不，这有点……\n话说回来，百合子，我觉得你休息一下比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "9d823bf0493344b497b14aa300db0e2df5f3077542853e2a722584c4f200449f", "ja": "休むって……そんなこと、してられません。\n今日みたいな失敗、地方公演では絶対できないし……。", "zh": "你说休息……我现在怎么能休息呢。况且我绝对不能在\n之后的地方公演，犯下像今天这样的错误……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "7f3a696c7ddfdcb72df83dc632b981560cc1b2d577342aa818b136fd4b1a284f", "ja": "それに私、もともとダンスが苦手だから……。\nみんなより頑張らなくちゃダメなんです。", "zh": "而且，我本来就不擅长跳舞……\n我必须比大家更努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "b00032757d91d5c085e0b11f58b5590cfe3a5cfd464b176fe1e03619859c53f2", "ja": "なら……。\n杏奈も劇場に、戻り……ます。", "zh": "这样的话……\n杏奈也要……回剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "5e8dac473ec8cb223ff37f0a42eb43f251245f0b596c3478be41d768f623e2c7", "ja": "ううん！　杏奈ちゃんは、帰って休んでね。\n私につき合わせるわけにいかないよ。", "zh": "不用啦！小杏就回去好好休息。\n我不能让你一直陪着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "55908e90dbac48d8e897fef138ba4e8d722cccb1b40fa9ef59ff26a42d8de1ed", "ja": "私も、気になってるところおさらいしたら、\nすぐに帰るから……。心配しないで。", "zh": "我复习完一些不足的地方后，\n也会马上回去的……不用担心我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1047_024ann", "source_sha256": "c4891f7f2f7c5382733edd31261e858ba69ca3a228c1e63b213ced29abb46f4f", "ja": "え、でも……。", "zh": "咦，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "642571fdd5631b8186aca5b9465da0614d55f0b09e66976cad670fa672f3a893", "ja": "（プレッシャーが少しずつ、いろいろな所に\nのしかかっている。これは……）", "zh": "（压力已经渐渐形成各种负担了。\n这样的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "2fdc0d60656a5692b1f9fc6f47a11e85ceefe73fcb274580c3c86677558fe478", "ja": "（ちょっと、決断が必要かもしれない）", "zh": "（说不定该由我做出决定。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
